codex
The origin address calculation checks out. Two premises need correcting: the existing LIN_B rows still have `linear == true` and return before colour dispatch, so they do not exercise tiled addressing. Also, one combined row is enough for the equality-only mutation class you specified.

The oracle is the larger issue: the changed default arm leaves `buf` uninitialized. A mistaken store can therefore leave the sentinel unchanged by coincidence.

