  61: # `#519` sgirandomcolour: the colour-type PUT default wrote four host-PRNG bytes into guest memory, and a DOCUMENTED colour type reached it
  62: 
  63: **THE DEFECT.** `horrible_getputpixel()` in `src/devices/dev_sgi_re.c` packs one pixel for the drawing
  64: engine's PUT by switching on the destination mode's TYPE nibble. Four of the sixteen nibbles are
